(7511520, 1198703, 48058, '<td valign="top">Very nice arrangement of colors and an excellent job bringing the clarity and sparkle out in the glass.</td>', 'Very nice arrangement of colors and an excellent job bringing the clarity and sparkle out in the glass.', '2017-05-02 01:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7511521, 1199132, 48058, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image, very good color and lighting. A little on the static side by their position but not bad.</td>', 'Very interesting image, very good color and lighting. A little on the static side by their position but not bad.', '2017-05-02 01:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7511522, 1199127, 48058, '<td valign="top">Very nice job with lighting and color. You kept the glare down but left the hightlights that add to the image. I keep wanting to adjust my monitor because it''s leaning a bit into the lower left corner just enough to be noticeable to me.</td>', 'Very nice job with lighting and color. You kept the glare down but left the hightlights that add to the image. I keep wanting to adjust my monitor because it''s leaning a bit into the lower left corner just enough to be noticeable to me.', '2017-05-02 01:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7511523, 1199026, 48058, '<td valign="top">My personal opinion is that there needs to be just a tad bit more apple showing, but still an excellent job of lighting, color and highlights.</td>', 'My personal opinion is that there needs to be just a tad bit more apple showing, but still an excellent job of lighting, color and highlights.', '2017-05-02 01:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7511524, 1198935, 48058, '<td valign="top">I find I spend most of my time viewing the image trying to figure out what it is (a porcupine quill?) rather than getting into the image.</td>', 'I find I spend most of my time viewing the image trying to figure out what it is (a porcupine quill?) rather than getting into the image.', '2017-05-02 01:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7511526, 1198900, 48058, '<td valign="top">An excellent job with the subtle colors although it seems like the center of interest (because of the area of brighter light) is the top of the vase rather than the flowers (and that might be how you intended it).</td>', 'An excellent job with the subtle colors although it seems like the center of interest (because of the area of brighter light) is the top of the vase rather than the flowers (and that might be how you intended it).', '2017-05-02 01:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7511527, 1198993, 48058, '<td valign="top">I flip flop back and forth on your image. On one hand it is interesting with good focus and lighting. On the other hand, the items are to "placed" and equally spaced out, giving the strong impression of staged.</td>', 'I flip flop back and forth on your image. On one hand it is interesting with good focus and lighting. On the other hand, the items are to "placed" and equally spaced out, giving the strong impression of staged.', '2017-05-02 01:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7511528, 1198819, 48058, '<td valign="top">Very nice color and lighting. The placement of the vase seems a little awkward on the edge of the cabinet though.</td>', 'Very nice color and lighting. The placement of the vase seems a little awkward on the edge of the cabinet though.', '2017-05-02 01:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7511529, 1199116, 48058, '<td valign="top">First off, I think you did a great job on the two items.  I do think that there is too much blank space though (lower left area without smoke). If I crop it a bit with my hands it pops out a bit more. Maybe if there was another item with these two it would have made the empty area stand out less.</td>', 'First off, I think you did a great job on the two items.  I do think that there is too much blank space though (lower left area without smoke). If I crop it a bit with my hands it pops out a bit more. Maybe if there was another item with these two it would have made the empty area stand out less.', '2017-05-02 01:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7511530, 1199064, 48058, '<td valign="top">Very good job with the lighting and front surface mirror. Good focus and balance of the items.</td>', 'Very good job with the lighting and front surface mirror. Good focus and balance of the items.', '2017-05-02 01:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7511531, 1199143, 48058, '<td valign="top">I don''t see a disclaimer that "No fish were harmed in the making of this image."  :D  I like the color and lighting. While there are a lot to look at in the picture, it doesn''t come out as being too busy. It does make me want to wrinkle my noise though.</td>', 'I don''t see a disclaimer that "No fish were harmed in the making of this image."  :D  I like the color and lighting. While there are a lot to look at in the picture, it doesn''t come out as being too busy. It does make me want to wrinkle my noise though.', '2017-05-02 01:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7511532, 1199092, 48058, '<td valign="top">I think your image came out too subtle. It takes a moment to realize what I''m looking at but even then it''s too much in the background. I see what you were trying to create but I think a bit more light on the arm chair would have helped. Maybe if it had been facing the window for the light coming through there?</td>', 'I think your image came out too subtle. It takes a moment to realize what I''m looking at but even then it''s too much in the background. I see what you were trying to create but I think a bit more light on the arm chair would have helped. Maybe if it had been facing the window for the light coming through there?', '2017-05-02 01:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7511533, 1199022, 48058, '<td valign="top">The flowers are nice but I think you cropped it to much or in the wrong place at the top.</td>', 'The flowers are nice but I think you cropped it to much or in the wrong place at the top.', '2017-05-02 01:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7511534, 1199118, 48058, '<td valign="top">Very good job with the lighting and focus. Also good selection of items that more or less go together.</td>', 'Very good job with the lighting and focus. Also good selection of items that more or less go together.', '2017-05-02 01:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
