(7512132, 1199075, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge<br/> <br/>A very colourful image. I like the radiating colourful patterns within the ornaments. The overall colours are all very appealing. One thing that could have improved it would be the adhesive lumps underneath the ornaments if they could have been a more uniform and smaller shape they would be so obvious especially as they are being reflected in the table surface. Apart from that I think it is quite an appealing image.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge A very colourful image. I like the radiating colourful patterns within the ornaments. The overall colours are all very appealing. One thing that could have improved it would be the adhesive lumps underneath the ornaments if they could have been a more uniform and smaller shape they would be so obvious especially as they are being reflected in the table surface. Apart from that I think it is quite an appealing image.', '2017-05-06 11:03:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(7512133, 1199064, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge<br/> <br/>Congratulations on your high score and placing, very well deserved. A great concept, very well executed. I like your original thinking behind the concept together with the variety of screw shapes and sizes very nicely lit and reflected in the mirror table top, it all works very well. Theres nothing to fault really, well done Chris.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge Congratulations on your high score and placing, very well deserved. A great concept, very well executed. I like your original thinking behind the concept together with the variety of screw shapes and sizes very nicely lit and reflected in the mirror table top, it all works very well. Theres nothing to fault really, well done Chris.', '2017-05-06 11:09:36.000000', NULL, 0),
